# Outfit body: long trench coat with an accent belt and collar (R23). V5.5: shaped, not a slab: an octagonal torso
# that follows the mannequin, a belt, a flared skirt split at the front, and a turned-up collar. Hollow.
name outfit_trench
grid 2
size 22 26 34
slot coat SwatchMain
slot belt SwatchAccent
# Torso: chamfered octagon around the chest.
poly 16 31 coat 3,6 6,3 16,3 19,6 19,20 16,23 6,23 3,20
# Skirt: wider at the hem, the same octagon stepped out (a voxel flare).
poly 0 7 coat 1,4 4,1 18,1 21,4 21,22 18,25 4,25 1,22
poly 7 14 coat 2,5 5,2 17,2 20,5 20,21 17,24 5,24 2,21
# Belt between them, one voxel proud.
poly 14 16 belt 2,5 5,2 17,2 20,5 20,21 17,24 5,24 2,21
# Collar: a turned-up ring above the shoulders.
poly 31 34 coat 4,7 7,4 15,4 18,7 18,19 15,22 7,22 4,19
# Hollow it: the mannequin stands inside.
carve poly 0 14 4,7 7,4 15,4 18,7 18,19 15,22 7,22 4,19
carve poly 14 31 5,8 8,5 14,5 17,8 17,18 14,21 8,21 5,18
carve poly 31 34 6,9 9,6 13,6 16,9 16,17 13,20 9,20 6,17
# Open front below the belt, and a V at the neck.
carve box 16 11 0 22 15 13
carve box 15 10 29 22 16 34
# Belt buckle.
box 19 11 14 21 15 16 belt
pivot 11 13 8
